  "description": {
   "en": "A yuri romantic comedy centered on a temporary relationship between a gal and an honor student. \n\nThe story begins when Manatsu, a gal who is on the verge of repeating a grade, starts receiving tutoring from Sumie, an honor student. Manatsu loves shoujo manga and romantic gossip but has the vague that having a boyfriend somehow doesn't fit her. \n\nWhen she casually brings this up, Sumie suggests, \"Why not try starting with just the form?\" and offers \"How about dating me for just 7 days?\""
  },
